ases as all the girls tries to become the lead singer. But, when a member becomes the lead singer that person falls victim to a horrible accident, one by one. Eun-Joo then realizes that the song \"White\" is cursed and she attempts to reveal the secret ...","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6}],"value":6,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":1153,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}